' Agent Flight Recorder (AFR) PlantUML 图集
' UTF-8；不使用远程 include。一个文件包含多个可独立渲染的图。

@startuml AFR_01_Context
title AFR 系统上下文与真实证据边界

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam ArrowColor #355C7D
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #355C7D
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #F7FAFC
skinparam actorBorderColor #1F4E78

actor "开发者" as Developer
actor "复核 / 审计人员" as Auditor

rectangle "薄入口" as Entry {
  rectangle "afr CLI" as CLI #D9EAF7
  rectangle "Codex Plugin\nskill（v0.1）\nhooks（v0.2 按需）" as CodexPlugin #E8F1FA
  rectangle "Claude Code Plugin\nskill（v0.1）\nhooks（v0.2 按需）" as ClaudePlugin #E8F1FA
}

rectangle "Agent Host" as Hosts {
  rectangle "Codex / codex exec" as Codex
  rectangle "Claude Code / 非交互模式" as Claude
  rectangle "其他命令行 Agent" as OtherAgent
}

rectangle "AFR 本地证据内核" as AFR #E2F0D9
rectangle "Git / 工作区" as Workspace #FFF2CC
database "~/.afr/sessions\n本地会话目录" as Store #FCE4D6
rectangle "本地浏览器\n离线 report.html" as Browser #EDE7F6
cloud "可选团队分析 / Dify\nP2，仅脱敏摘要" as Dify #F2F2F2

Developer --> CLI : 直接运行
Developer --> CodexPlugin : 调用 skill
Developer --> ClaudePlugin : 调用 skill
CodexPlugin --> CLI : 组装 argv，不实现证据链
ClaudePlugin --> CLI : 组装 argv，不实现证据链

CLI --> Codex : wrapper 模式
CLI --> Claude : wrapper 模式
CLI --> OtherAgent : wrapper 模式
CodexPlugin ..> AFR : v0.2 正式 hook JSON
ClaudePlugin ..> AFR : v0.2 正式 hook JSON

CLI --> AFR : 进程 / 输出 / 状态
AFR --> Workspace : before / after / Git delta
AFR --> Store : 只写已脱敏证据
Auditor --> AFR : list / show / show --open / verify / clean
Auditor --> Browser : 打开本地报告
Browser --> Store : 读取单文件 HTML
Store ..> Dify : P2，用户显式允许的脱敏摘要

note right of AFR
  唯一实现：
  - 会话与进程托管
  - 写盘前脱敏
  - 本地规则
  - seq / 哈希链
  - manifest / report / verify
end note

note bottom of Workspace
  L1 只能证明工作区内 before/after。
  未启用 OS 监控时，任意外部写入与
  实际网络流量必须显示 not_observable。
end note

legend left
  |= 线型 |= 含义 |
  | 实线 | v0.1 必需数据流 |
  | 虚线 | v0.2/P2 可选增强 |
endlegend
@enduml

@startuml AFR_02_Components
title AFR 核心组件与信任边界

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam ArrowColor #3B5B79

package "不可信输入（禁止直接落盘）" #FFF2CC {
  component "Child Process\nstdout / stderr / exit" as Child
  component "Native Hook Decoder\nP2" as HookDecoder
  component "Git / File Collector" as Collector
}

package "AFR 内存安全管线" #E2F0D9 {
  component "CLI Router" as Router
  component "Process Supervisor" as Supervisor
  component "Event Normalizer" as Normalizer
  component "Bounded Record Reader" as Bounded
  component "Streaming Redactor" as Redactor
  component "Capability-aware\nPolicy Engine" as Policy
  component "Sequencer +\nHash-chain Writer" as Writer
}

package "本地持久化" #D9EAF7 {
  database "Session Store" as SessionStore
  component "Manifest Builder\nevidence / derived" as Manifest
  component "Verifier" as Verifier
  component "Report View Model" as ViewModel
  component "Markdown / Risk JSON /\nOffline HTML" as Reports
  component "Safe Cleaner" as Cleaner
}

Router --> Supervisor : argv[] / workspace
Supervisor --> Child : spawn / signal / wait
Child --> Supervisor : raw streams + result
Supervisor --> Normalizer : process candidates
HookDecoder ..> Normalizer : native candidates（P2）
Collector --> Normalizer : before / after / delta
Normalizer --> Bounded
Bounded --> Redactor : bounded text or metadata
Redactor --> Policy : redacted event
Policy --> Writer : event + findings
Writer --> SessionStore : append-only events
Redactor --> SessionStore : redacted evidence artifacts
SessionStore --> Manifest : finalized evidence list
Manifest --> SessionStore : atomic manifest.json
SessionStore --> ViewModel : verified, redacted structures
ViewModel --> Reports
Reports --> SessionStore : atomic derived artifacts
SessionStore --> Verifier : stream read
Verifier --> SessionStore : no mutation
Cleaner --> SessionStore : exact validated target only

note right of Redactor
  所有持久化内容必须经过这里。
  二进制、超长或无法安全解析的内容
  fail-closed：只存 size/hash/reason。
end note

note bottom of Policy
  规则只能处理已经看见的事实。
  没有 native/OS 证据时不能声称
  观察到隐藏工具、外部写入或网络流量。
end note

note bottom of Writer
  v0.1 wrapper：单进程单 writer。
  v0.2 hooks：O_EXCL session lock 串行 seq/hash；
  只有实测瓶颈才引入常驻单写者。
end note
@enduml

@startuml AFR_03_Run_Sequence
title afr run 正常、失败与中断时序

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
autonumber

actor "用户" as User
participant "afr CLI" as CLI
participant "Session Store" as Store
participant "Workspace Collector" as WS
participant "Child Agent" as Agent
participant "Output Capture" as Capture
participant "Redactor + Policy" as Safe
participant "Event Writer" as Writer
participant "Reporter" as Reporter

User -> CLI : afr run [flags] -- argv[]
CLI -> CLI : 校验 argv / workspace / config
CLI -> Store : 创建权限受限 session\n原子写初始 session.json
CLI -> Writer : 打开唯一 writer
Writer -> Store : session_started
CLI -> WS : collect before
WS --> CLI : Git/file baseline + pre-existing
CLI -> Safe : baseline candidates
Safe -> Writer : redacted baseline events
Writer -> Store : append + flush

CLI -> Agent : spawn argv[]
CLI -> Capture : 启动 stdout / stderr drain
Capture -> Writer : process_started

par stdout
  loop 每个 bounded record
    Agent -> Capture : stdout raw bytes
    Capture --> User : 原样终端显示（不持久化）
    Capture -> Safe : 副本 + raw byte count/hash
    Safe -> Writer : redacted process_output / finding
    Writer -> Store : seq + chain hash + append
  end
else stderr
  loop 每个 bounded record
    Agent -> Capture : stderr raw bytes
    Capture --> User : 原样终端显示（不持久化）
    Capture -> Safe : 副本 + raw byte count/hash
    Safe -> Writer : redacted process_output / finding
    Writer -> Store : seq + chain hash + append
  end
end

alt child 正常或非零退出
  Agent --> CLI : exit code
  CLI -> Writer : process_exited(exit_code)
else 第一次 Ctrl+C
  User -> CLI : interrupt
  CLI -> Agent : 转发信号 / 进入宽限期
  alt 宽限期内退出
    Agent --> CLI : terminated result
  else 超时或第二次 Ctrl+C
    CLI -> Agent : 终止完整 process tree
    Agent --> CLI : killed result
  end
  CLI -> Writer : session_interrupted(actual result)
else AFR 被硬杀 / 断电
  note over CLI,Store
    无机会写中断事件。
    后续 list/show 从缺失收尾和 torn tail
    推断 incomplete，不伪造历史。
  end note
end

CLI -> WS : collect after
WS --> CLI : final state + session delta
CLI -> Safe : final evidence / Diff
Safe -> Writer : redacted workspace_final + findings
Writer -> Store : append
CLI -> Writer : session_finished
Writer -> Store : flush / sync / close
CLI -> Store : 原子写 final session.json
CLI -> Reporter : build from redacted evidence
Reporter -> Store : 原子写 md/json/html
CLI -> Store : 最后原子写 manifest.json
CLI --> User : session ID / capability / risk / report\n返回 child 或 AFR 契约退出码
@enduml

@startuml AFR_04_Session_State
title AFR v0.1 会话状态机

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei

state "Starting" as Starting
state "Running" as Running
state "Finalizing" as Finalizing
state "Completed" as Completed #E2F0D9
state "Failed" as Failed #FCE4D6
state "Interrupted" as Interrupted #FFF2CC
state "Incomplete" as Incomplete #F4CCCC

[*] --> Starting : 已通过参数校验\n创建 session
Starting --> Running : session_started + baseline\nchild started
Starting --> Failed : child 启动前可记录失败
Running --> Finalizing : child exit 0 或非 0
Running --> Interrupted : 收到 signal / child 被强杀
Interrupted --> Finalizing : 已记录实际终止结果
Finalizing --> Completed : events/session/reports/manifest\n完成并关闭
Finalizing --> Failed : 可诊断的收尾失败

Starting -[dashed]-> Incomplete : AFR hard kill / power loss\n后续命令推断
Running -[dashed]-> Incomplete : AFR hard kill / torn tail\n后续命令推断
Finalizing -[dashed]-> Incomplete : artifact/manifest 未完成\n后续命令推断

Completed --> [*]
Failed --> [*]
Incomplete --> [*] : 只读复核，不续写 events

note right of Completed
  Completed 表示证据正常收尾。
  child_exit_code 可以是非零；
  业务失败与证据失败分开。
end note

note bottom of Incomplete
  只读取最后完整事件前缀。
  torn tail 保留 size/hash，绝不静默截断。
end note
@enduml

@startuml AFR_05_Evidence_Activity
title 证据从原始输入到本地制品的安全活动流

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei

start

partition "Raw Sources（不可信）" #FFF2CC {
  :接收 argv / stdout / stderr /\nGit/File / optional hook JSON;
  :累计原始字节数与会话级 HMAC 指纹;
}

partition "In-Memory Safety" #E2F0D9 {
  if (可安全解析为有界文本记录？) then (是)
    :标准化字段与编码;
    :应用内置脱敏\n（用户 RE2 为 P1 计划）;
    :使用会话内 HMAC 生成关联占位符;
  else (否)
    :丢弃正文;
    :生成 omitted(size, fingerprint, reason);
  endif

  if (超过 stream / Diff 容量上限？) then (是)
    :停止保存后续正文;
    :继续 drain、计数与计算\n会话级 HMAC 指纹;
    :生成 truncation marker;
  endif

  :基于可见能力运行确定性规则;
  :生成 redaction / truncation /\nnot_observable metadata;
}

partition "Normalized Evidence" #D9EAF7 {
  :一次性编码 event body bytes;
  :分配严格递增 seq;
  :计算 prev_hash + current hash;
  :单行追加 events.jsonl;
  :按策略 flush / sync;
}

if (写入或链处理失败？) then (是)
  :标记 evidence gap / incomplete;
  :不得静默当作完整会话;
else (否)
  partition "Finalized Artifacts" #EDE7F6 {
    :冻结 evidence artifacts;
    :从已脱敏结构生成 Markdown/JSON/HTML;
    :原子写 manifest(evidence, derived);
  }
endif

stop
@enduml

@startuml AFR_06_Data_Model
title AFR v1 数据模型与校验关系

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class "Session" as Session {
  +format_version: uint
  +session_id: string
  +status: SessionStatus
  +started_at: RFC3339
  +finished_at: RFC3339?
  +child_exit_code: int?
  +final_event_hash: hex?
  +capabilities: Capability[]
  +coverage_gaps: CoverageGap[]
}

class "EventEnvelope" as Event {
  +format_version: uint
  +prev_hash: hex
  +body: RawJSON
  +hash: hex
}

class "EventBody" as Body {
  +seq: uint64
  +ts: RFC3339
  +elapsed_ns: uint64
  +type: string
  +source: string
  +payload: object
}

class "Capability" as Capability {
  +name: string
  +status: observed | partial | not_observable
  +source: string
  +reason: string?
}

class "RiskFinding" as Risk {
  +rule_id: string
  +rule_version: string
  +basis: observed | inferred
  +severity: info | low | medium | high
  +evidence_seq: uint64[]
  +explanation: string
  +action: string
}

class "Artifact" as Artifact {
  +relative_path: string
  +kind: evidence | derived
  +size: uint64
  +sha256: hex
  +truncated: bool
  +source_final_hash: hex?
}

class "Manifest" as Manifest {
  +format_version: uint
  +session_id: string
  +final_event_hash: hex
  +evidence: Artifact[]
  +derived: Artifact[]
}

class "VerificationResult" as Verify {
  +status: pass | fail | incomplete
  +first_bad_seq: uint64?
  +bad_artifact_path: string?
  +expected: string?
  +actual: string?
  +coverage_gaps: CoverageGap[]
}

class "CoverageGap" as Gap {
  +capability: string
  +reason: string
  +first_seq: uint64?
}

enum SessionStatus {
  starting
  running
  finalizing
  completed
  failed
  interrupted
  incomplete
}

Session "1" *-- "0..*" Event
Event "1" *-- "1" Body
Session "1" *-- "1..*" Capability
Session "1" o-- "0..*" Gap
Session "1" o-- "0..*" Risk
Risk "0..*" --> "1..*" Body : evidence_seq
Session "1" o-- "0..1" Manifest
Manifest "1" *-- "1..*" Artifact
Verify "1" --> "1" Session
Verify "1" --> "0..1" Body : first bad event
Verify "1" --> "0..1" Artifact : first bad artifact
@enduml

@startuml AFR_07_Plugin_Sequence
title v0.1 薄插件与 v0.2 Hook 增强时序

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
autonumber

actor "开发者" as User
participant "Codex / Claude\nPlugin Skill" as Skill
participant "afr CLI" as AFR
participant "Agent Host" as Host
participant "Host Hook Dispatcher\nP2" as Hooks
participant "afr hook\nP2" as HookCLI
database "Session Store" as Store

group v0.1：skill 只启动新的 wrapper 会话
  User -> Skill : 请求记录一个任务
  Skill -> AFR : afr version / PATH check
  alt CLI 缺失或版本不兼容
    AFR --> Skill : 稳定错误
    Skill --> User : 安装/升级指引\n不声称已记录
  else CLI 可用
    Skill -> User : 明示“将启动新的被记录任务”
    Skill -> AFR : afr run -- host non-interactive argv[]
    AFR -> Host : spawn child host
    Host --> AFR : stdout/stderr/exit
    AFR -> Store : L1 + workspace + policy
    AFR --> Skill : session ID / report / exit
    Skill --> User : 复核入口
  end
end

group v0.2：只有真实证据缺口触发 Hook
  Host -> Hooks : SessionStart / Prompt / Tool / Permission / Stop
  Hooks -> HookCLI : 正式 JSON stdin\n继承或映射 AFR_SESSION_ID
  HookCLI -> HookCLI : 脱敏 + 会话锁 + seq/hash
  HookCLI -> Store : 追加 native event
  HookCLI --> Hooks : exit 0 / stdout empty\n记录失败默认 fail-open

  alt 外层 wrapper 已设置合法 AFR_SESSION_ID
    note over HookCLI,Store
      L2 事件并入同一 L1 会话，
      不产生重复 session。
    end note
  else plugin-only 当前会话
    note over HookCLI,Store
      映射 host session；报告明确没有
      完整进程输出能力。
    end note
  end

  alt Codex Stop（无可靠 SessionEnd）
    Hooks -> HookCLI : Stop
    HookCLI -> Store : refresh + status=idle
  else Claude Code SessionEnd
    Hooks -> HookCLI : SessionEnd
    HookCLI -> Store : quick finalize status=completed
  end
end
@enduml

@startuml AFR_08_Deployment
title 构建、插件打包与本地部署

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei

artifact "Go Source" as Source
artifact "afr.exe\nWindows x64 v0.1" as WinBin #D9EAF7
artifact "afr\nLinux/macOS beta" as UnixBin #F2F2F2

folder "Shared Plugin Root" as PluginRoot {
  artifact ".codex-plugin/plugin.json" as CodexManifest
  artifact ".claude-plugin/plugin.json" as ClaudeManifest
  artifact "skills/afr/SKILL.md" as SharedSkill
  artifact "hooks/hooks.json\nP2" as CodexHooks
  artifact "hooks/hooks.claude.json\nP2" as ClaudeHooks
}

cloud "Codex Marketplace / Local Source" as CodexMarket
cloud "Claude Marketplace / --plugin-dir" as ClaudeMarket

node "Developer Windows Machine" as Machine {
  component "afr.exe on PATH" as InstalledCLI
  component "Codex" as InstalledCodex
  component "Claude Code" as InstalledClaude
  database "~/.afr/sessions" as SessionStore
  component "Local Browser" as Browser
}

Source --> WinBin : go build + version metadata
Source ..> UnixBin : same source / beta builds
WinBin --> InstalledCLI : install/copy
PluginRoot --> CodexMarket
PluginRoot --> ClaudeMarket
CodexMarket --> InstalledCodex : install/enable
ClaudeMarket --> InstalledClaude : install/enable
SharedSkill ..> InstalledCLI : invokes
InstalledCodex ..> InstalledCLI : skill / optional hook
InstalledClaude ..> InstalledCLI : skill / optional hook
InstalledCLI --> SessionStore : one AFR format
SessionStore --> Browser : offline report.html

note bottom of PluginRoot
  先验证两个宿主能否共用同一根。
  只有真实 validator/loader 失败才拆发布包；
  skill 与 CLI 始终只有一个业务来源。
end note

note right of SessionStore
  插件升级、禁用、卸载
  不删除历史会话。
end note
@enduml

@startuml AFR_09_Verify_Sequence
title afr verify 流式完整性校验

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
autonumber

actor "用户 / CI" as User
participant "afr verify" as Verify
database "session.json" as Session
database "events.jsonl" as Events
database "manifest.json" as Manifest
collections "evidence / derived artifacts" as Artifacts

User -> Verify : afr verify <session|latest> [--json]
Verify -> Session : read + validate format/status
Session --> Verify : session_id / final_hash / capabilities
Verify -> Events : open streaming reader

loop 每个完整 LF 事件行
  Events --> Verify : raw envelope + exact body bytes
  Verify -> Verify : 校验 format / seq 连续\nprev_hash / current hash
end

alt 存在 torn tail
  Events --> Verify : final non-LF bytes
  Verify -> Verify : status=incomplete\n记录 size/hash，不截断
else 完整事件流
  Verify -> Verify : 比较 session final_event_hash
end

Verify -> Manifest : read evidence/derived lists
Manifest --> Verify : sorted relative paths + size/hash

loop 每个 artifact
  Verify -> Artifacts : stream SHA-256 / size
  Artifacts --> Verify : actual metadata
  Verify -> Verify : compare expected vs actual
end

alt 首个事件或制品异常
  Verify --> User : exit 2 + first_bad_seq/path\nexpected/actual
else incomplete 但有效前缀一致
  Verify --> User : 明确 incomplete + coverage gap
else 全部通过
  Verify --> User : exit 0 + verified final hash
end
@enduml

